# Fastlane Appfile for Aria — intentionally minimal.
#
# Aria is a Swift package and ships no signed app. None of the
# release lanes in this Fastfile need an Apple ID, App Store
# Connect API key, or team id. If you're looking for the Avyra
# app's signing / submission config, see
# https://github.com/3theories/avyra/blob/main/fastlane/Appfile.
